no method 'cycle' on type 'VecIntoIter': `cycle` starts each round from a copy of the iterator (`where Self: Clone`), and `VecIntoIter` is not `Clone`: an owning iterator (`into_iter()`) is not, nor is a view library/iterators.md § `cycle` does not list. Cycle a view over a `Vec`, `Array`, `Slice` or `VecDeque` (`v.iter().cycle()`) and clone what you keep, or collect the items into a `Vec` and cycle over its `iter()`
